---
description: Testing conventions
globs: "**/*.test.{ts,tsx},e2e/**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Tests sit next to code: `Thing.tsx` + `Thing.test.tsx`.
- Render with `renderWithProviders` from `@/test/render` (i18n + QueryClient). Query by role, label or text; avoid test ids.
- Assert behavior from the requirement (states: loading, empty, error, success), not implementation details.
- Mock the network at `fetch` (`vi.stubGlobal('fetch', ...)`), not internal modules.
- Bugfix: write the failing test first and keep it.
- E2E (`e2e/`): user flows and states against the production build; use message keys from `messages/*.json` instead of copy-pasted strings; axe for each new page in light and dark.
- No `.only`; `.skip` needs a reason in the title.
